# systemd --user timer: e2e on main every 5 hours at an off-minute (owner 2026-10-04: "maybe every 5h") (WP-978). Install: see docs/process/e2e.md.
[Unit]
Description=Run e2e on main every 5 hours

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 00/5:17:00
RandomizedDelaySec=300
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
